Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:24:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/20] References: merge five duplicate entries, cite Ament et
 al. NeurIPS 2023 for acquisition optimization

- Five works were in both .bib files under different keys and printed twice
  (Shahriari 2016, BayBE, Altamirano 2023, Lin 2022, Ramakrishnan 2014); the
  project summaries now cite the main-text keys.
- Sections V.B and VII cited 'Sustainable concrete via Bayesian
  optimization' for acquisition optimization and scalable hypervolume
  acquisitions; the intended work is Ament et al., 'Unexpected improvements
  to expected improvement for Bayesian optimization' (NeurIPS 2023), which
  introduces LogEI and qLogNEHVI. Project 12 still cites the concrete paper
  for its dataset.
- Section IV: 42 projects link to a code repository (4 of them inaccessible),
  not 42 public repositories.
